.TH "GSSDP\-DEVICE\-SNIFFER" "1" "November 2022" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gssdp\-device\-sniffer \- display SSDP packets on your network
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]gssdp\-device\-sniffer\f[R] [\f[B]\-i\f[R]] [\f[B]\-6\f[R]]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
gssdp\-device\-sniffer is a tool that will listen for SSDP announcements
that happen on your network.
.PP
In addition to recording the SSDP packets and providing raw display, it
will also keep track of the devices it has seen.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\f[B]\-h\f[R], \f[B]\[en]help\f[R]
Display help
.TP
\f[B]\-i\f[R], \f[B]\[en]interface\f[R]
Name of the network interface the sniffer will listen on
.TP
\f[B]\-6\f[R], \f[B]\[en]prefer\-v6\f[R]
Listen on IPv6 for SSDP announcements
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Jens Georg.
